window.products.push({"id":378131,"name":"Egg Cooker, PowerDoF Multifunctional Double Layer Rapid Electric Egg Steamer Boiler with 14 Egg Capacity Auto Shut Off Feature","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51L-aieIJaL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"How to make poached eggs: fill water-measuring cup with cold water to the medium 4 line. Pour water into center of water reservoir. Always make sure the center of reservoir is filled first before outer ring. Place egg holder and then poaching tray on top of Heating unit. Lightly spray poaching tray with nonstick cooking spray. Crack large eggs, one at a time, into each poaching section. You can poach 14 eggs at one time. Cover with lid. Press the on (|) switch. Red light will be lit. Eggs will cook about 6 to 8 minutes. Remove eggs. Serve immediately. specifications: model Number: zdq-702apower (W): 360voltage (V): 110 v-120vcapacity (quart): 14switch: Rocker switch material: stainless steel+pcweight: 0. 95Kgdimension: 19. 5x 19. 5x18. Outerwear> package includes: 1 x egg cooker1 x electric user manual","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51L-aieIJaL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PowerDoF","source_asin":"B077CQ86FM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-378131","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077CQ86FM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B077CQ86FM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
