window.products.push({"id":378227,"name":"PURE ERA Jersey Knit Duvet Cover Set 100% T-Shirt Cotton Super Soft Comfy, Solid Green Queen, with Zipper Closure (3pc Bedding Set, 1 Comforter Cover ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Xhol+tsgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"What's Duvet Cover? A duvet cover is essentially a fabric bag for a comforter. It works almost the way a pillowcase covers a pillow. The only difference: A duvet cover is typically closed with buttons, zippers, or ties.  Duvet covers do two jobs: First, they protect comforters from dust, sweat and dirt (this is important, because down comforters should only be washed every one to three years). And second, as one of the largest visual elements in the bedroom, they serve as a key anchor for the room's overall style—and, happily, one that's easy to change when you're ready for a new look. Why Buy From US? We bring you exceptionally soft luxury duvet cover set at an affordable price! Easy care thin breathable natural cotton that last! Stylish design instantly brings a fashion forward look to any room's decor!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Xhol+tsgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PURE ERA","source_asin":"B07W5PFCNX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-378227","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07W5PFCNX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07W5PFCNX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
