window.products.push({"id":378415,"name":"Wilton Extra Long Non-Stick Tart and Quiche Pan, the Fluted Edges on Your Tarts and Quiches will Add a Touch of Flair, 14 x 4.5-Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.84,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610JXUK3isL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"No Sunday brunch is complete without a beautiful tart or quiche made with the Wilton Extra Long Tart and Quiche Pan. The fluted edges create an elegant look, while the non-stick surface allows foods to come right out with minimal cleanup. This extra-long 14 in. x 5 in. Rectangle Tart Pan bakes the perfect party serving. Cut diagonally for individual pie-shaped slices. Removable bottom supports the baked crust while you slip off the pan’s outer edge for easy slicing and serving. A tart is a fantastic dessert for the family or guests whether you treat them to a chocolate pecan mousse tart, lemon meringue or fudge truffle-pecan tart. This pan is also great for breakfast dishes. Bake up a mouthwatering Quiche Lorraine, Easy Broccoli Quiche or Sour Cream Chicken Quiche. Have fun in the kitchen. Whether you love to bake once a week or once a month, Wilton has the bakeware to help you make the most out of your favorite foods. From aluminum cake pans to durable, non-stick all-purpose cookie sheets, there's something for everyone. Replace your old bakeware or build on your current collection with an assortment of standard, shaped and silicone pans.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610JXUK3isL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wilton","source_asin":"B07DMGNX5B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-378415","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DMGNX5B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DMGNX5B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
