window.products.push({"id":378425,"name":"Gold Vinyl Placemats Set of 6 Vinyl Heat-Resistant Table Mats with Matching a Same-Style 72 inches Table Runner(7pcs,Gold)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71T5TaJt2uS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Place mats and table runner gold may seem like a frivolous extra when setting the table, but they actually serve a functional purpose as well as aesthetic. If you are bored of those old placemats and looking forward to something more stylish to give your interior an elegant look than our “Weltex Store” set placemats might be a perfect choice for you. Exquisite design, eye catching color and durable quality will give an outstanding look to your interior and tables. Convenient For Long Term Use Our vinyl placemats and table runner are made using premium quality material which makes them last longer than average table mats. PVC material gives the texture a perfect and anti-fraying smooth finish along with properties like non-slip, stain and water resistance. These round place mats and table runner are perfect to be placed on table cloth, due to their long term heat toleration (up to 90 degrees). They offer a protective barrier to prevent your table cloths from burning in contact with hot dishes. Perfect for Decorations Our metallic pressed vinyl heat resistant placemats kit with table runner come in a delicate gold color and discrete leafy design which makes it a must have product for occasions. They impart a glam touch wherever placed and perfect for decorating tables on weddings, Christmas, Thanksgiving and birthday parties. A great gift idea for newly married couples and anyone who is fond of decorating their home Cleaning Instructions These placemats only require a damp cloth to clean. For heavier-duty spills like wine and oil, they can be prewashed with a mild soap. The round gold placement with table runner is a stylish addition to any table NOTE: Avoid machine washing and tumble drying. Avoid machine washing and tumble drying. Do not use strong alkaline detergents or bleach Do not use strong alkaline detergents or bleach","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71T5TaJt2uS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Weltex store","source_asin":"B0942D8ZYH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-378425","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0942D8ZYH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0942D8ZYH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
