window.products.push({"id":378537,"name":"Mawa by Reston Lloyd BodyForm Series Non-Slip Space-Saving Clothes Hanger For Jackets, Suits & Coats, 16-1/2\", Style 42/L, Set of 5, Silver","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6197pNY+6cL._AC_SL1482_.jpg","description":"In 1948 Martin Wagner had the vision to manufacture the best clothes hanger in the world. That dream became a fully automated manufacturing process that combines specialized Machinery, professional designers/engineers, and experienced sales staff. Mawa pioneered the market with patented technology such as turnable hooks, anti-slip coating, and clip hangers. Mawa delivers 100Percent \"made in Germany\" clothes hangers to 58 countries to ensure high quality materials and designs are offered throughout the world. Managing director, Michaela Schenk has made consumer safety her top priority. All materials used for production can be recycled and water Consumption in the manufacturing process has been reduced by 80Percent . Mawa is environmental friendly and certified in accordance with Germany's strict ecologic standards. The culmination of European standards and Mawa dedication to high standards, results in a product which is not hazardous to the customer or planet. Our body form non-slip jacket hanger is perfect for coats, jackets and suits. As its name implies, this hanger is carefully shaped to replicate the human form. It's carefully made to care for the finest suits. With our exclusive grip coating over the strength of cold-rolled steel and welded shoulder flares and pant bar, even the heaviest garments will be well-cared for. The hanger's slim and sleek design allows you to maximize space your closet space by 40Percent while keeping your clothes secure while being stored. It also has a turnable hook to hang it in different directions. All Mawa products hang uniformly to create an even neat look. Your clothes do not need to suffer, and neither does your wallet. Take care of your clothes by using the Mawa line of hangers. Save space, get organized and treat your garments & yourself with the utmost care.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6197pNY+6cL._AC_SL1482_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MAWA","source_asin":"B07QDBW825","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-378537","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QDBW825","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QDBW825","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
