window.products.push({"id":378552,"name":"Dukhni Oud Al Raghbah Bakhoor عود الرغبة بخور 3 Boxes x 9 Piece Each | Arabic Bakhoor Incense | Zesty Woody Oud Blend | Perfect for Prayer Time | to R","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81sWRR2xV6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CONTENTS: This includes 3 boxes of Oud Al Raghbah Bakhoor. Each box has 9 pieces of bakhoor + 1 sample of a new scent FRAGRANCE DESCRIPTION: Oud Al Raghbah is a wild blend that opens with a wildflower and nutmeg accord, a lemongrass and rosewood heart and a softly refreshing base of oakmoss, vetiver, musk and agarwood. Cool and fresh, this is an energising scent designed to enliven the senses ABOUT DUKHNI: Dukhni Bakhoor is made from a traditional recipe using sustainably-sourced natural ingredients for their aromatic properties. Each fragrance combines essential oils, which are carefully blended to create unique and evocative scents. Dukhni's bakhoor is made in small batches to ensure high quality and consistency. It will release fragrance for hours, creating a wonderfully scented atmosphere.The end result is a long-lasting, luxurious scent that will delicately perfume your home. Dukhni Bakhoor is available in a range of scents, so you can find the perfect one to suit your needs. Our bakhoor is also sustainably sourced and cruelty free, making it a more ethical choice HOW TO USE: Dukhni Bakhoor can be burned the traditional way on charcoal. Place a piece of bakhoor on hot charcoal and enjoy as fragrant smoke fills up your room. It will burn for approximately 15min but the aroma will be long lasting. Our signature burners allow for a new way of burning bakhoor with ease. Simply place a piece of bakhoor on the copper plate and light the tealight below. We recommend tealight candles with a 3.5 to 4 hour burn time. The beauty of our burner is that it burns without smoke, steadily building up the flavour of the bakhoor and ensuring its longevity. In an unventilated room, the aroma of the bakhoor will spread to about 400 square feet HERITAGE: Dukhni is a family-owned business that specializes in the art of developing fragrances and incense. Our journey began in 1907, five generations ago in Aden, an ancient port city in Yemen that formed part of the historic Incense Route. We mastered the art of blending botanical extracts, oils, flowers and woods together to craft our own aromatic recipes","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81sWRR2xV6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dukhni","source_asin":"B07KS924VH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-378552","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KS924VH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KS924VH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
