window.products.push({"id":378593,"name":"Blake & Lake Large Wooden Box with Hinged Lid - White Keepsake Boxes for Jewelry and more - Wooden Storage Box - Decorative wood boxes with lids Treas","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71k1dYKHgnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Organize your home or office with a premium handmade white keepsake box! Expertly handcrafted wooden box with a 90 degree hinged lid for a hands free experience. Perfect for storing and organizing collectibles, keepsakes, baby toys, mail, jewelry, crafts, small electronics, and even fits a few articles of clothing! Keep your personal belongings safe from humidity and other contaminants. When the box is closed the inner lip creates a seal to keep moisture, humidity, dust, and other pollutants out of the box and away from your keepsakes and collectibles! Designed to organize and make space on desks, inside drawers, on shelves, countertops, and in kitchens, bathrooms, and bedrooms! When storing soaps or other fragrant items the lid locks the smells inside Perfectly sized for your home or home office! Dimensions are 11” long, 8.” wide, and 5.25” tall. Inside dimensions are 10” long, 7.5” wide, and 5” tall. Our largest stash box yet! This Wooden Keepsake Box was expertly hand assembled from premium oak and cedar wood and built to last a lifetime! All wood was sourced from eco friendly and sustainable sources. Bright and Bold New Colors! This box also comes in Black, Natural Dark Oak, and Heritage Red! A classic yet modern design with a Matte White finish will look amazing in your home or office! Open the box to enjoy the luxury of real cedar wood.The cedar wood is hand sanded and lightly finished to bring out the natural wood tones and grains. No two boxes will look exactly the same!  Check out more colors and from Blake & Lake Give the Gift of Organization with a wooden storage box by Blake and Lake. Buy more wooden storage boxes with hinged lids to organize your entire home! The White color is a perfect baby box or art box! Comes with the Blake & Lake custom box which makes it perfect for gift wrapping. Bring home a Blake and Lake Keepsake box and declutter your home or office today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71k1dYKHgnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Blake & Lake","source_asin":"B092T3DHSQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-378593","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092T3DHSQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092T3DHSQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
