window.products.push({"id":378663,"name":"Heated Blanket Electric Blanket Throw - Wearable Heating Blanket with 6 Heating Levels & 10 Hours Auto Off, Soft Flannel to Sherpa LED Display Washabl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vChWn0I5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🎁【Softer & Warmer Material】: The fabric of the heated blanket is made from 220GSM Flannel + 220GSM Sherpa , which is uniquely designed to lock heat, reduce heat loss and provide a skin-friendly experience. Let you don't even feel cold in bed/couch/office napping in winter. 🎁【Level 1 Safety Heating】: The heated blanket has passed strict international testing standards, such as UL/FCC/CE (Ultra-low level EMF radiation will not influence human health); furthermore, Prikpont electric blankets have NTC overheating & Overload & Earth leakage protection system which automatically switches the blanket off in the event of a fault, making them safe for all night use. 🎁【Upgraded LED Controller】: The digital controller of heated throw blanket has equipped with a large LED screen, which provides 6 Heating Levels(101-131°F) with 4 Timer Auto-Off (2/4/6/10 H), this temperature and time is 10% like comparable products on the market, bringing the best experience for you or your lover to have a ideal winter night. A .9ft power cable makes our electric throw blankets work flexibly anywhere, such as in the bedroom, living room and office. 🎁【Fast Heat & Constant Temperature】:The electric heated blanket has 72 ft lengthened and imported from Japanese company heating wire, the heat distribution is wider, evenly, precise and constant temperature. It can be heated to 99°F with 3-4 minutes（maximum temperature can reach 131°F within 20minutes), Prikpont heat blankets electric can promote blood circulation, warming and relaxing your body to alleviate exhaustion. 🎁【Energy Saving & Memory Heating Design】: The heater blankets was the most energy saving choice compared to space heaters completed by the U.S. Department of Energy,because the small heated blanket will automatically adjust the temperature according to the surrounding environment When the temperature rises,which can always provide users with a comfortable feeling. and it can revert automatically to the last comfort level setting when you turn on the controller.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vChWn0I5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Prikpont","source_asin":"B0BGKZMJR2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-378663","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BGKZMJR2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BGKZMJR2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
