window.products.push({"id":378729,"name":"Just B Reusable Zip-lock Sandwich Bags - Extra Thick Sandwich and Food Pouch for Vegetables, Fruits, Biscuits and Snacks - Leakproof Lunch PEVA Contai","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NszZXa6SL._AC_SL1498_.jpg","description":"Want to save money while saving the planet? At first glance, disposable plastic containers might be the obvious choice for your food-storing needs. They’re cheap, convenient, and almost everyone uses them. However, you’re only putting your family and planet’s well-being at risk while burning a hole in your pocket. Health risks are just the tip of the iceberg. At the rate we're using disposable plastics, our oceans will end up filled with them, ultimately becoming harmful microplastics in the fish we eat. Preserve your food’s quality and our planet’s life with Just B’s Reusable Storage Bags. Each pack of Just B’s food storage bags contains ten reusable PEVA pouches. Use them to keep your ingredients easy to access while keeping your pantry and fridge well-organized. From green, leafy vegetables to leftovers, Just B food bags have got you covered. Our containers are a healthier alternative to plastic--it will never leach chemicals nor taint your food with odd odors and tastes. We’ve included six 7.28 x 8.66” sandwich bags and four 4.7 x 8.66” reusable snack bags—perfect for road trips and camping. We equipped each PEVA bag with double ziplock closures for effortless access and air-tight sealing. The bag’s durable and tear-resilient construction assures you of long-time use. Please note that these bags are not for use with dishwashers, ovens, and microwaves. Still not convinced? Check out these features to help you make a decision: ✅ Freezer-safe ✅ Easy to clean by hand ✅ Makes for an ideal housewarming gift ✅ Your purchase is protected by a money-back warranty Even small changes make a big impact. So add Just B’s Reusable Storage Bags to your cart TODAY!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NszZXa6SL._AC_SL1498_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Just B","source_asin":"B07Z6R2F99","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-378729","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Z6R2F99","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Z6R2F99","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
