window.products.push({"id":378738,"name":"Juvale Round Cake Carrier with Lid and Handle for 10-Inch Desserts (12 x 5.9 In)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41tYbwEgE-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Easily transport or store your baked goods with our handy cake carrier! It features a versatile round shape, a collapsible handle, and a lid. Not only great for carrying 10-inch cakes, but this round container is also great for carrying pies, a couple of cupcakes, baked goods, and cheesecakes. This cake container measures approximately 12 inches in diameter and 5.9 inches in height. Use it to transport goods from your home to your office, to school, to a party, and more! Made with durable semi-transparent material, this cake holder won’t easily crack or fade with use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41tYbwEgE-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Juvale","source_asin":"B08Z78123H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-378738","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Z78123H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Z78123H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":378739,"name":"Large Laundry Hamper with Lid - 105L Rolling Laundry Hamper with Wheels, Dirty Clothes Hamper with Laundry Bag Portable for Living Room, Bathroom, Toy","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71w8fgp6N9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"900 cationic fabric 【105L Large Capacity Laundry Hamper】The rolling laundry hamper (17.7\"x13.7\"x25.5\") can meet the needs of the family to store dirty clothes a week. Not only used as tall laundry cart, but also an organizer bin for clean clothes, kids toys. 【Laundry Hamper with Wheels】The wheels on our laundry basket are already installed, no need to install the wheels, very convenient. Laundry basket with wheels makes it easy to transport, so you can effortlessly move the dirty clothes basket directly to the washing machine, toddler’s room, living room, bedroom and other places you wanna go. 【Durable Freestanding Laundry Hamper】Clothing hamper is made of high quality waterproof 900 Cationic Fabric and Bamboo handles, lightweight and durable, the laundry hamper with handles looks super stylish, framework design make the rolling laundry cart keeps long-lasting strength and reliable performance. 【Collapsible Laundry Hamper】The collapsible laundry basket can be folded into a tiny size, you can store it into closet drawer or cabinet when not in use. The humanized foldable design brings more convenience to your life. 【Laundry Hamper with Lid】A lid on the clothes hamper protects your privacy. Flip down to conceal any odors at bay and keep the dirty clothes out of sight, making your space look nicer and tidy. It is ideal to hide away clothes from guests. 【Clothes Hamper with Removable Liner Bag】The rolling laundry basket comes with one washable and removable liner bag for your convenience, you can take laundry liners for your camping, travel, or just storage bags. 【Versatile Laundry Basket for Storage】The portable laundry hamper can meet all your needs. You can use the laundry hamper for clothing organization or storage stuff in the home, laundry room, living room, college dormitory, apartment, hotel, and even camping. It is suitable for all ages of people such as single men women, housewives, mothers with children, teens, seniors and people with limited mobility. So the laundry basket is also the best choice as a gift. 【Simply 5-minute Installation】If you don't know how to install the laundry basket, we have a picture and text manual for you to understand the installation. Easy and quick installation of this foldable laundry basket, all you need to do is insert the fibre rods into the fabric strips and then attach the velcro of the removable laundry bag. 【Service Commitment】We put a lot of love and energy into the design of this laundry hamper. For any reason you're not completely happy with your purchase, please contact us in time, we provide 24-hour online service. One year to replace defective products and 30 days for replacement and return without reason.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71w8fgp6N9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MITUKIYOUNG","source_asin":"B09Y5G8212","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-378739","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Y5G8212","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Y5G8212","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
