window.products.push({"id":378776,"name":"YACEYACE Jute Beach Tote Bags, 12.6\" x 5.1\" x 8.2\" Pack of 3 Small Burlap Travel Tote Bags Reusable Tote Bags Reusable Grocery Bags Bridesmaid Bags To","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710tmCdT+OL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Canvas,Jute Imported 【Quantity and Dimensions】Including 3Pcs 12.6L x 5.1W x 8.2H inches.It's small size tote bags for big childrens or teens. Kindly note that please read the bag's size as picture 2nd show. Make sure it match with your requirements. 【Quality and Materials】Made of the natural burlap fabric and canvas. Well made, durable, good material and construction, stand up on their own. All THE NATURAL BURLAP AND JUTE PRODUCTS HAVE A SMELL BUT SAFTY. AND IT WILL BE GRADUALLY DISSIPATES AFTER A FEW DAYS USE OR PLACING. We must be recommend that you should think carefully before purchasing. 【Sturdy Cotton Handles】The natural cotton handles extremely sturdy, soft and round. Giving comfortable touching. Easy to carry or convenience slung over a shoulder.The bags are made with dense thread and exquisite workmanship. All seams are reinforced and sewn to ensure their durability, holds up well more heavy duty items, fit so much reusable. 【Film and Cleaning】The interior was covered with a waterproof PE film lined. The lined interior means can holds groceries and in the event something leaks, it is easy to clean out. We do not recommend soak or machine washing which will make destory. The best cleaning way that clean interior with a wet cloth and air-dry. 【Personalized DIY】Creating the unique gifts will bring us fun and meaning. These bag's surface allows to write, painting or designs. Add a sticker, use a stamp, decorated with scarves, draw directly inkjet on them and more. Show the personal customization for family, friends and customers,etc. 【Multi-Use】Great travel bags and groceries bags. Put the vegetable,snacks,fruits,milk,soda,canned foods as well as books, towel, sunglasses and more. Suitable for take to the beach trip, picnics, gym,farmer market shopping,etc. Also a nice bridesmaids bags for wedding gifts.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710tmCdT+OL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YACEYACE","source_asin":"B0C2V4J1P2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-378776","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C2V4J1P2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C2V4J1P2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
