window.products.push({"id":378930,"name":"NewAir Portable Heater (240V) Portable Electric Garage Heater Heats Up to 800 sq. ft. with 6-Foot Cord Wrap and Carrying Handle | 5600 Watt Portable E","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":134.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VGJ2NeT5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Portable Electric Garage Heater is perfect for any space that reaches up to 800 square feet. Whether you have a two-car garage or large workshop, this electric heater will provide the warmth you need to stay toasty in the dead of winter. The heater comes with a 240v 30 amp-plug. Take advantage of the cord wrap, carry handle, and lightweight design to move your heater to the most convenient place in your space. 1. Quickly and Evenly Heats Up to 800 Square Feet of Space Get quick heat from a fan powerful enough to spread warm air evenly throughout an 800 square foot space. If you have a two-car garage, large workshop or shed, you’ll remain warm while you do your work, even if it’s in the dead of winter. 2. Portable Features to Put it in The Perfect Place Take advantage of 2 portable features: the cord wrap and carry handle. Together they make it easy for you to position or move your heater to the most ideal place in your garage, workshop, or shed. 3. Rugged Exterior Built to Last The NewAir G56 is durable and built to last. The tough exterior is meant to stand up to cold climates and even tougher working conditions. 4. Set It and Forget It Temperature Controls Set the temperature you want. Once the space has reached the ideal temperature, the fan will automatically kick-in as needed to keep your workshop warm. It’s that easy to get the heated working environment you need in winter. 5. Smart Safety Features for Peace of Mind This heater comes with an automatic shut-off function to prevent the risk of overheating. It also comes with a cool touch housing feature to prevent accidents. The plug is 30-amp and has 3-prongs to fit in a dedicated 240-volt outlet. Did we mention its UL-certified? Enjoy the safety features for complete peace of mind while you work.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VGJ2NeT5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NewAir","source_asin":"B009NJ6K8K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-378930","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B009NJ6K8K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B009NJ6K8K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
