window.products.push({"id":378940,"name":"32Pcs Bread Proofing Basket Set, West Bay 10 Inch Round & 8 Inch Oval Cane Sourdough Basket w/ Bread Lame Dough Scraper Linen Liner Brush Flouring Ste","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816br6Dak3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍞ALL IN ONE BREAD PROOFING KIT: West Bay bread proofing kit include 1x10inch round basket, 1x8inch oval basket, 2 x Washable Linien Lners, 1xDanish Dough Whisk,1 x Metal Dough Scraper, 16 x Flouring Stencil Sheets, 1 x Bread Scoring Lame with Case and 5 Blades so you have everything you need to get started. 🍔HIGH QULAITY BASKET WITH NATURAL RATTAN CANE : 100% Handmade brotform that has no splinter due to our 2 steps polishing process, our sour dough bread basket supports dough during the rising process and wicks away excess moisture, prints a beautiful ring design into your bread loaf. And the material also allows the bread dough to stay warm, absorb moisture and regulates fermentation optimally for a nice texture and a crispy crust. 🍔PROFESSIONAL SOURDOUGH KIT :The complete artisan bread baking tools and gadgets set has specialized accessories, cloth liners creating a smooth surface for scoring designs, 1 stainless steel bench scraper to cut and shape your dough, a danish dough wisk tool designed to stir the wet dough. 1 brush to help clean the basket, the professional scoring knife with 5 extra blades.and the 16 bread flouring stencil sheets that together make sure your bread always look just as good as it tastes. 🍞PERFECT GIFT FOR BREAD LOVERS - With an elegant gift box and detailed instructions, our bread baking tools and gadgets set makes for a unique gift for friends and family on every occasion. Its the perfect gift for Birthdays, Anniversaries, Christmas, Thanksgiving, New Year’s and more. 🍞EASY TO CLEAN AND STORE: To clean the basket, brush the leftover dried dough with out tool scrub brush, shake the excess flour out after each use, and then store it in a dry and ventilated space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816br6Dak3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"West Bay","source_asin":"B08LK6CLR8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-378940","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08LK6CLR8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08LK6CLR8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
